I unpack my backpack.
I put all the ingredients on the table in the kitchen.
Then I set up my phone.
I press play and the cooking video starts.
He looks directly into the camera.
"Hello everyone, cook with me today!" he calls.
"First we make the potato salad."
He holds a potato in the air.
"Take a kilo of potatoes!" he says.
"Wash the potatoes very well!"
I smile because he explains everything so dramatically.
I take the potatoes and wash them.
The video on my phone continues playing.
"Then boil the potatoes in salted water!" the chef calls.
I take a large pot from the cupboard.
I put water and some salt into the pot.
Afterwards I put the pot on the stove.
I turn on the stove.
Step one is already done!
